  "details": "Since VRChat 2026.2.3 `Build 1864`, an additional prompt to cancel was added to the first \"Report content\" page before any content is selected for reporting. This is unnecessary and a regression.\n\nI often look at the Report UI to see a print or emoji I may have missed, with no intent to report anything. Sometimes there isn't even anything to report in an instance, yet the new UX forces me to confirm with a click I don't have anything to report.\n\nPlease remove the \"Cancel Report\" prompt where seen on the attached video (except for the \"World\" button), and simply discard/cancel the report automatically.",
